OL,3,GNEWSAThe choir who proudly admits they
OL,4,Acannot sing
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight years ago, Diane Chapman placed
OL,7,Fan advert in a local paper for choir
OL,8,Fmembers but there was one unusual
OL,9,Fstipulation.
OL,11,F"If you can't sing come and join my
OL,12,Fchoir," the notice read.
OL,14,F"I put out 15 chairs that night," said
OL,15,F60-year-old Diane, who admits she was
OL,16,Funsure if anyone would turn up.
OL,18,F"I didn't think we'd fill them...then
OL,19,F55 people came."
